	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[先退回主干道 (0:04)|Forest]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[调整状态再试 (0:03)|MP Night Event Forest 2]]>><<set $daily.mpNightEv_forest_2 to 0>><<pass 3>><</link>>
