:: MP Night Event Park 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
宵禁后的公园长椅笼罩在梧桐树影里，喷泉池边的石栏上落着一只忘记锁扣的画师写生皮袋，巡夜警哨声从远街隐约传来。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[趁夜色返回 (0:02)|Park]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpNightEv_park_1 is 1>>
今日已来过此处。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-night-event-park-1">
<<sneakicon>><<link "趁巡警未至收皮袋 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-night-event-park-1">>
